sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Pipeline
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Trainer Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant TrainingPod as Training Pod
    participant StatusSrv as Status Server<br/>10443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,API: Flow 1: TrainJob Reconciliation

    User->>API: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: User kubeconfig
    API->>Webhook: Mutating webhook<br/>TLS (cert-controller)
    Webhook-->>API: Defaulted TrainJob
    API->>Webhook: Validating webhook<br/>TLS (cert-controller)
    Webhook-->>API: Validation result
    API-->>User: TrainJob created

    Controller->>API: Watch TrainJob events<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>Controller: TrainJob event
    Controller->>API: Get TrainingRuntime/ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>Controller: Runtime template
    Note over Controller: Apply ML framework plugins<br/>(PyTorch, DeepSpeed, MPI, etc.)
    Controller->>API: Create JobSet CR<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>API: Create PodGroup CR<br/>(gang scheduling)
    Controller->>API: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token

    Note over JobSet,TrainingPod: Flow 1b: Training Execution

    JobSet->>TrainingPod: Create training pods
    Note over TrainingPod: dataset-initializer runs<br/>(init container)
    TrainingPod->>HFHub: Download dataset<br/>HTTPS/443
    HFHub-->>TrainingPod: Dataset artifacts
    Note over TrainingPod: model-initializer runs<br/>(init container)
    TrainingPod->>HFHub: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443
    HFHub-->>TrainingPod: Model weights
    Note over TrainingPod: Training begins

    Note over TrainingPod,StatusSrv: Flow 2: Status Reporting (Feature-Gated)

    TrainingPod->>StatusSrv: POST /namespaces/{ns}/trainjobs/{name}/status<br/>10443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Projected SA token (OIDC)
    StatusSrv->>API: SSA patch TrainJob status<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>StatusSrv: Status updated

    Note over Prometheus,Metrics: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping

    Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer token (SA)
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
